# MAGIC # 19 - Hand review of the held matches
# MAGIC Task D (a teammate's notebook), matching pass 2 (notebook 17) and the Rural Hospital Network matcher (notebook 14) held 289 matches as `ambiguous`. Ishaan asked for them to be reviewed (2026-11-22). Each one was read by hand against the names, pincodes, addresses and map distances, and given one of three decisions.
# MAGIC
# MAGIC | Decision | Rule |
# MAGIC |---|---|
# MAGIC | `accepted` | The distinctive name words agree and the place agrees (same pincode and town for NABH, map points within about 1 km for eRaktKosh and Wikidata). Stored as `accepted_medium`, never high |
# MAGIC | `rejected` | A clear mismatch: a different town, a different name, or a different kind of institution |
# MAGIC | `left_for_review` | Not clear from the data. Stays `ambiguous`, is used nowhere, and is listed for Ishaan with a one-line reason |
# MAGIC
# MAGIC **Why most NABH rows were held.** NABH lists one organisation several times, once per programme (hospital accreditation, nursing, emergency, digital health, empanelment). Task D saw several equally good records and held them all. Where the records are the same organisation, one is kept per facility: the highest class present (hospital accreditation, then other accreditation, then certification, then withdrawn, then empanelment). The reason names the record kept and the other classes.
# MAGIC
# MAGIC **Nothing is overwritten.** Task D's tables and the pass 2 table are not changed. Decisions go to `vf_silver.ext_match_review_decisions`. The reviewed rows go to `vf_silver.ext_facility_matches_reviewed` (same columns as Task D's matches). The view `vf_silver.ext_facility_matches_all` is now Task D plus pass 2 (`ext_facility_matches_prereview`) with the reviewed rows laid over them. The Rural Hospital Network decisions are recorded here only: none was accepted, so notebook 14's tables are unchanged.
# MAGIC
# MAGIC An accepted match is identity evidence only. It never validates a service and nothing becomes `verified`.
# MAGIC
# MAGIC Run after 17 and before 09, 13, 14, 15.

